uys_screenshot4.png", "id": "1799940564131119", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393703_1799940570797785_3585675818044526529_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EqIAhd1L3IkQ7kNvwH2FHic&_nc_oc=AdoeInuum-jQ9mkC_CbEEFdbV9AVOaSqZWxpxkMw47UFOHOrCKG5NCLqkYWW3-RAXME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_j75lIqeYyez89mPiHRI-vOTq9jX56V_gUMR6oR6ZzJw&oe=6A2EBB0C"}, {"file_name": "twentyguys_screenshot5.png", "id": "1395524361610653", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1395524364943986_3311960218610784276_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EGzaRULNcBQQ7kNvwGw02Jy&_nc_oc=Adqnr4RVm6bXhtC2kWrYAoOMFU0htnmTdyPClPg6g5I0NPWEEFuXzDldN1-b9oiUHU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_iDtQNwvAz9W92dq2tg2PqX4kAVuagax_cYnVqxiPnKw&oe=6A2EC62A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "twentyguys_meta_landscape.png", "id": "9180708208673870", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391974_9180708215340536_3763626524122213711_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t2ZLDvmxDQQQ7kNvwElbfN-&_nc_oc=AdrOgMVmWbqeXYlExKIwI1G9UHVcSLL8XHxd3jGqzDrwmNbIM1UcneMsG0zg6GWRNOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ggazJoStbwjmZAO5_kluTXcKvlQ3MdKUUqxendaamDg&oe=6A2ECBD5"}, "display_name": "Twenty Guys \u2013 Early Access", "keywords": ["free", "ragdoll", "toy"], "long_description": "# So, you\u2019ve got twenty guys...\n\n\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffe\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udfff\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udfff\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udfff\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\n\nOh, and there are also fun tools, like a hammer, cheese-on-a-stick and a glue gun. What could possibly go wrong?\n\n\u200e\n\n# This is what players love about Twenty Guys:\n- \u201cI\u2019ve got twenty guys!\u201d\n- \u201cWhooow, I\u2019ll try to smash them all!\u201d\n- \u201cSo, what if I get them all up here on this thing?\u201d\n- \u201cAh, they are looking at me! Why are they following me?! Hahaha\u201d\n- \u201cOk, so\u2026 bowling ball. Hahahahahahahahaha.\u201d\n- \u201cHaha, the most fun with a hammer. EVER!\u201d\n- \u201cLet\u2019s see\u2026 if I grab this one and\u2026 haha. What? Haha, f**k!\u201d\n\n\u200e\n\nTwenty Guys is in **Early Access**, and **free** to play. Download, enjoy and join the community to give feedback and drop ideas of what to do next with these twenty guys. Their survival is in your hands.\n\nJoin our discord at **reso.ly/TwentyGuys**!\n\n\u200e\n\n\u200e\n\n(This game does NOT include cats, gorillas nor any security.)", "short_description": "So, you\u2019ve got twenty guys..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.resolutiongames.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.resolutiongames.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Resolution Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.resolutiongames.com/twentyguys", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES